  "behavior": [
    "Compose completed tiles in effects1024..4095, then write only different final pixels to GOP; no intermediate background/window/glyph layers reach the front buffer on this path",
    "Borrow retained op cache after damage/pointer comparison; rebuild cache at frame end. Band op index at12800..13835; audio/blur/cursor bytes remain disjoint; no compiler/ABI or memory grant change",
    "8-row tile widths96/48/32/24/16 depend on local blur count0/1/2/3/4; two-pixel halo per bounded blur; ten-pixel dependency test before painting; reject more than4 local blur ops",
    "Preserve exact clipped, rounded, tinted, gradient, glyph and overlapping blur semantics; opaque-covered earlier layers can be skipped",
    "Keep forced-full F3 direct painter as reference; unknown/nonopaque first op and excessive local blur depth use reference path; pointer-only save-under retained",
    "Remove visual boot debug marks, redundant boot op timing traces and unused renderer parameters; signed remote command and UDP/DRAM diagnostics remain"
  ],
